          "reviewBody": "We joined the Bromo–Ijen–Sewu trip with JVTO, and we were lucky to have Rendi and Anjas as our tour guides. They were absolutely amazing! Both of them were clear with their instructions, helpful throughout the journey, and brought such good vibes to the whole experience.\n\nThey provided strong emotional support and knew exactly how to connect with our young team. Always friendly, patient, and cheerful, they made a physically demanding trip feel a lot more enjoyable.\n\nIf we get the chance to travel with JVTO again, we truly hope Renji and Anjas will be our guides once more. Highly recommended!",
